00:09:46.048 --> 00:09:49.041
and feeling beautiful is really incredible

00:09:49.041 --> 00:09:53.088
because I know she does not
have a lot of self-confidence

00:09:53.088 --> 00:09:56.238
often but I could tell you felt beautiful.

00:09:56.238 --> 00:09:58.121
- I feel like I'm ready
to have a really fun night

00:09:58.121 --> 00:09:59.266
a night I'll never forget.

00:09:59.266 --> 00:10:00.616
Let's go to prom!

00:10:00.616 --> 00:10:02.850
(cheers)

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.433
(upbeat music)

00:10:10.463 --> 00:10:12.987
- [Sage] I'm excited to
wear exactly what I want

00:10:12.987 --> 00:10:15.295
feel really confident and to
be feeling really confident

00:10:15.295 --> 00:10:18.101
next to Caitlyn and knowing
that she's feeling good

00:10:18.101 --> 00:10:20.801
and that we can, like, do anything.

00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:22.635
- [Quinn] This Quinn that
you're going to see at the prom

00:10:22.635 --> 00:10:25.010
is definitely the Quinn
that I want to express.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:28.092
Fierce, fabulous, a queen, a badass bitch

00:10:28.092 --> 00:10:31.242
and she does not take no for an answer.

00:10:31.242 --> 00:10:33.600
- [Rowan] I'm with people
that I've barely met

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.709
yet I felt so comfortable with them.

00:10:35.709 --> 00:10:38.620
So it was nice to share
the experience with them

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.238
and be able to be a part of it.

00:10:40.238 --> 00:10:42.102
- Queer proud!

00:10:42.102 --> 00:10:44.685
(upbeat music)

00:10:46.726 --> 00:10:48.325
- [Narrator] Now that our
prom court has revealed

00:10:48.325 --> 00:10:51.294
their gorgeous, stunning,
and sickening prom looks

00:10:51.294 --> 00:10:52.693
they're gonna jump into a limo

00:10:52.693 --> 00:10:55.703
and head over to Buzzfeed's queer prom.

00:10:55.703 --> 00:10:57.489
- [Offscreen Person] How's
it feel being in a limo?

00:10:57.489 --> 00:10:58.322
- Whoo!

00:10:58.322 --> 00:10:59.812
- Feels pretty great!

00:10:59.812 --> 00:11:02.883
- Oh my God, look there's rainbows!

00:11:02.883 --> 00:11:05.466
(upbeat music)

